He also teaches the classes,
the glass-blowing classes.

24
00:00:53,354 --> 00:00:56,023
There's one for
freshmen during IAP,

25
00:00:56,023 --> 00:00:58,425
and there's another
one in the spring.

26
00:00:58,425 --> 00:00:59,460
They're very popular.

27
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:04,131
But because you're in
3091, he'll get you in.

